UUID: a0308aa5-00ef-4e8b-b322-b0dc07c703a1
This dataset represents the statistical mixture of the two different disposal ways for WEEE devices in Switzerland.
Location: data of the situation in Switzerland
Technology: current mix of manual and mechanical treatment in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 82.5 kt total WEEE
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a0308aa5-00ef-4e8b-b322-b0dc07c703a1.xml</text>
